{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"5500000000001001","type":"group","x":0,"y":0,"width":1320,"height":1180,"label":"01 · 概念与口径 / Concepts and measurement","color":"5"},
		{"id":"5500000000001002","type":"group","x":1540,"y":0,"width":1320,"height":1180,"label":"02 · 变化核算与边界 / Changes and inference","color":"6"},
		{"id":"5500000000001003","type":"group","x":0,"y":1440,"width":1320,"height":1020,"label":"03 · 单位与岗位 / Units and jobs","color":"3"},
		{"id":"5500000000001004","type":"group","x":1540,"y":1440,"width":1320,"height":1020,"label":"04 · 诊断与评价 / Diagnosis and evaluation","color":"4"},
		{"id":"5500000000000000","type":"text","x":0,"y":-330,"width":2860,"height":220,"text":"# 结构转型、生产率重配与非正规部门\n\n先读上排：如何量度、怎样分解；再读下排：怎样分类、如何评价。颜色只区分阅读区。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nRead the top row for measurement and decomposition, then the bottom row for classification and evaluation. Colours identify reading sections only.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n[[02_Economy/10_发展经济学/08_结构转型与劳动生产率|连续阅读课程：结构转型与劳动生产率]]"},
		{"id":"5500000000000001","type":"text","x":60,"y":70,"width":480,"height":300,"color":"5","text":"### 结构转型\n\n经济活动在产业之间持续重配；就业份额与增加值份额分别观察。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nEconomic activity shifts persistently across industries. Observe employment and value-added shares separately.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n[[结构转型|打开概念 · Structural transformation]]"},
		{"id":"5500000000000010","type":"text","x":780,"y":70,"width":480,"height":300,"color":"5","text":"### 劳动生产率\n\n产出除以匹配的劳动投入。本组用可比价增加值／就业人数；工时口径另配权重。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nOutput per matching labour input. Here: comparable-price value added per employed person; hours-based measures need hours weights.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n[[劳动生产率|打开定义 · Labour productivity]]"},
		{"id":"5500000000000012","type":"text","x":60,"y":570,"width":480,"height":300,"color":"5","text":"### 产出与就业份额\n\n$v_i=s_i p_i/P$。40% 的就业可以生产约 72.7% 的增加值，两种份额不能互换。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nOn a matching basis, a 40% employment share can produce about 72.7% of value added. The two shares are not interchangeable.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n[[产出与就业份额|打开辨析 · Output and employment shares]]"},
		{"id":"5500000000000011","type":"text","x":780,"y":570,"width":480,"height":300,"color":"5","text":"### 劳动生产率加总\n\n增加值和就业可同口径加总时，$P=\\sum_i s_i p_i$；权重是就业份额。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nWith additive value added and matching employment coverage, aggregate productivity is the employment-weighted average.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n[[劳动生产率加总|打开恒等式 · Productivity aggregation]]"},
		{"id":"5500000000003001","type":"text","x":60,"y":950,"width":1200,"height":200,"text":"### 从同一张表到两个时期\n\n先对齐可加增加值、就业和部门范围，再由[[劳动生产率加总|加总恒等式]]展开[[劳动生产率分解|两期变化]]。链式量值不能任意加总；部门内项也不是[[增长核算的 TFP 残差|TFP 残差]]。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nAlign additive value added, employment and sector coverage before decomposing changes. Chain-linked volumes need not add, and the within-sector term is not a TFP residual.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"},
		{"id":"5500000000000013","type":"text","x":1600,"y":70,"width":480,"height":350,"color":"6","text":"### 劳动生产率分解\n\n初期就业份额计部门内项，末期生产率计重配项。两项精确；换成初期生产率须另列交互项。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nInitial shares weight the within term; final productivity weights reallocation. This is exact. Initial-productivity reallocation needs an interaction term.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n[[劳动生产率分解|打开方法 · Two-period decomposition]]"},
		{"id":"5500000000003002","type":"text","x":2320,"y":70,"width":480,"height":350,"text":"### 一组数，两种精确写法\n\n$s_0=(0.6,0.4),\\ p_0=(2,8)$；$s_1=(0.5,0.5),\\ p_1=(3,10)$。\n\n$4.4\\to6.5$，增量 $2.1=1.4+0.7=1.4+0.6+0.1$。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nThe same change is within plus final-weight reallocation, or within plus initial-weight reallocation plus interaction.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n[[劳动生产率分解|逐项复算 · Check each component]]"},
		{"id":"5500000000000002","type":"text","x":1600,"y":670,"width":480,"height":350,"color":"6","text":"### 离农与生产率重配\n\n部门生产率和总就业固定、所有人仍就业时，转移份额 $\\delta$ 的贡献是 $\\delta(p_B-p_A)$；目的地决定符号。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nWith fixed sectoral productivity and total employment, and everyone still employed, the destination gap determines the sign. Leaving agriculture alone is insufficient.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n[[离农与生产率重配|打开方向边界 · Reallocation sign]]"},
		{"id":"5500000000000003","type":"text","x":2320,"y":670,"width":480,"height":350,"color":"6","text":"### 平均生产率与迁移收益\n\n$Y/L$ 是平均值；额外劳动带来的增产是边际问题。即使资本固定，二者也可能不同，不能仅凭平均差预测迁移收益。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nOutput per worker is an average; additional output from labour is marginal. They may differ even with fixed capital. Average gaps alone do not establish migration gains.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n[[平均生产率与迁移收益|打开推论边界 · Average versus marginal gains]]"},
		{"id":"5500000000000030","type":"text","x":60,"y":1510,"width":480,"height":310,"color":"3","text":"### 非正规部门\n\n按 ILO 2023 分类经济单位：主要面向市场营利，但缺少规定的正式市场生产者身份。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nThe 2023 ILO standard classifies market-oriented economic units lacking the specified formal recognition as market producers.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n[[非正规部门|打开定义 · Informal sector]]"},
		{"id":"5500000000000031","type":"text","x":780,"y":1510,"width":480,"height":310,"color":"3","text":"### 非正规就业\n\n按工作关系判断有酬或营利活动在法律上或实际中是否获正式安排覆盖；不能只问有没有书面合同。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nClassify pay- or profit-generating work by legal or effective formal coverage appropriate to its work relationship, not merely a written contract.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n[[非正规就业|打开定义 · Informal employment]]"},
		{"id":"5500000000003003","type":"text","x":60,"y":2060,"width":1200,"height":300,"text":"### 两条轴，有制度约束\n\n按 ILO 2023，正规单位可以有非正规岗位；市场单位若雇有正规岗位雇员，会被归入正规部门。因此不能随意画成四种均可的组合。产业和城乡是另外的分类轴。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nUnder ILO 2023, formal units can have informal jobs. A market unit employing an employee in a formal job is classified as formal. The axes are distinct but do not permit every combination unrestrictedly. Industry and location are separate classifications.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n[[非正规部门|单位分类]] · [[非正规就业|工作分类]] · [[结构转型|产业结构]] · [[非正规标签与经营约束|分类之后再诊断约束]]"},
		{"id":"5500000000000032","type":"text","x":1600,"y":1510,"width":480,"height":310,"color":"4","text":"### 非正规标签与经营约束\n\n同一统计身份不代表同样的资本、能力或市场约束；小规模也不能单独判定增长潜力。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nA shared statistical status does not identify common capital, capability or market constraints. Small size alone does not determine growth potential.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n[[非正规标签与经营约束|打开诊断边界 · Status and constraints]]"},
		{"id":"5500000000000033","type":"text","x":2320,"y":1510,"width":480,"height":310,"color":"4","text":"### 正规化政策评价\n\n先明确改变登记、税务还是岗位保护；评价相对反事实的企业与劳动者结果及资源成本。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nSpecify registration, tax status or job protection. Evaluate firm and worker outcomes against the counterfactual and resource costs.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n[[正规化政策评价|打开评价判断 · Formalization policies]]"},
		{"id":"5500000000003004","type":"text","x":1600,"y":2060,"width":1200,"height":300,"text":"### 把核算与政策证据分开\n\n换成末期 $p_1=(3,7)$：哪一项使总量仍上升？再问“新增 200 家登记企业”说明了什么。核算解释变化，登记是交付；政策净效果还要[[公共项目反事实|反事实]]，并区分[[项目投入产出与结果|交付与最终结果]]。\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nChange final productivity to $(3,7)$: which component still raises the aggregate? Then ask what 200 new registrations establish. Accounting explains the change; registration is an output. Net policy effects require a counterfactual and a distinction between outputs and outcomes.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n[[02_Economy/10_发展经济学/08_结构转型与劳动生产率#7. 合上材料，完成一次判断|进入课程自检 · Apply the full chain]]"}
	],
